OL,3,GNEWSAA30 closed in both directions
OL,4,Aafter incident
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe A30 in mid Cornwall has been closed
OL,7,Fin both directions due to a ongoing
OL,8,Fpolice incident.
OL,10,FDevon and Cornwall Police said officers
OL,11,Fwere called to reports of concern for a
OL,12,Fperson's welfare at about 06:05 GMT
OL,13,Ffollowing an incident at the Victoria
OL,14,FServices slip near Roche.
OL,16,FNational Highways South West said
OL,17,Ftraffic was diverted off at the exit
OL,18,Fslip and back on at the entry slip, and
OL,19,Fdrivers should expect delays of about
OL,20,F15 minutes on approach and two miles
OL,21,F(3.2km) of congestion.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
